:{"text":"沿着贴在地板上的，白色的胶带前进。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-17c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-17c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"然后，在走廊尽头的小型电梯\n我乘上它……","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-1da","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1da"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"按下了最顶楼的按钮。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-268","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-268"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"叮，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-301","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-301"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"7楼。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-31e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-31e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"眼前的是，护士的值班室。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-355","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-355"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"好几个护士小姐，一同往这边看来","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-394","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-394"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不过，知道是我后又移回视线。\n好像，什么都没看到一样，继续工作。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-436","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-436"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"休闲室。\n最近我都在这里。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-478","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-478"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"大屏幕的电视播放着，新春的特别节目。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-4b9","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-4b9"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不知道该看什么的我。\n没什么事能做。也没有其他能做的事。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-527","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-527"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……从那之后已经过了快一个月。\n虽说好像是有些变化，又似乎什么都没变的感觉。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-599","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-599"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"到头来，我的父母倒是如设想一般发着牢骚。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-5d6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-5d6"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"然后…让我有些不明白的是，她父母却很感谢我。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-61f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-61f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……这两者的差距，让人印象深刻。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-6ba","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-6ba"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「早」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-6df","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-6df"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"回头一看是不认识的女性。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-71f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-71f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……你是？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-76e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-76e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「新来7楼照顾你的陪护。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-7d7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-7d7"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「请多指教。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-806","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-806"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"开朗的样子，然后低下头行礼的她。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-843","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-843"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"似乎是个新人的样子。\n恐怕她也是，来询问那件事的吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-8a1","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-8a1"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……关于那一件事情。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-8cc","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-8cc"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"只有一部分的相关人员知道详细的情况，\n这个医院，也已经传出了各种各样的谣言。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-950","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-950"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"虽然大概并不是因为兴趣的关系……\n不过也因此，有很多各种各样的人跑来问我。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-9db","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-9db"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……你也知道了？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-a38","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a38"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「嗯，有听说了喔，关于那一件事的。」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-a80","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a80"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……这样啊……」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-aa5","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-aa5"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这个人也一定，觉得她挺乱来的吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-af4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-af4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"就算把事情告诉了他们，\n大部分的人也都只是皱下眉头。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-b54","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-b54"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"所以我，\n不太喜欢对别人说……","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-be4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-be4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「瀨津美……」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-c37","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-c37"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……最后有微笑着吗？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-c79","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-c79"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……唉？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20\",\"main\"]/mjo-cc6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_20","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-cc6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「如果是这样的话……我也很高兴的……」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_one